<!DOCTYPE html><html dir="ltr" lang="en-GB" prefix="og: https://ogp.me/ns#"><head><script data-no-optimize="1">var litespeed_docref=sessionStorage.getItem("litespeed_docref");litespeed_docref&&(Object.defineProperty(document,"referrer",{get:function(){return litespeed_docref}}),sessionStorage.removeItem("litespeed_docref"));</script> <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><link rel="profile" href="https://gmpg.org/xfn/11"> <script class="_iub_cs_skip" type="litespeed/javascript">var _iub=_iub||{};_iub.csConfiguration=_iub.csConfiguration||{};_iub.csConfiguration.siteId="1663726";_iub.csConfiguration.cookiePolicyId="92204292"</script> <script class="_iub_cs_skip" type="litespeed/javascript" data-src="https://cs.iubenda.com/autoblocking/1663726.js"></script> <title>Our brokerage services | Commerg</title><meta name="description" content="We work with businesses that are ready to commit to renewable energy; our brokerage service provides them with the best price. We provide real-time data for Guarantees of Origin, by monitoring the market every day and to give you the chance to choose the right GOs. We carefully listen to your needs and we provide assistance before, during and after the negotiations. We provide you with a high customizable platform which allows you to trade only at your conditions."><meta name="robots" content="max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1"><meta name="google-site-verification" content="dXgV23KqJHGF2HT8mqmHlz378bgSol8iy8dRRnkFvpU"><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.commerg.com/brokerage-service/"><meta name="generator" content="All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 4.8.7"><meta property="og:locale" content="en_GB"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Commerg"><meta property="og:type" content="article"><meta property="og:title" content="Our brokerage services | Commerg"><meta property="og:description" content="We work with businesses that are ready to commit to renewable energy